<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ doc_label }} {{ doc_no }}</title>
<style>
/* ===========================================================================
   云枢 ERP 退货单模板（PDF-04：采购退货单 / 销售退货单共用一份）
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   结构：页眉 → 单据头（单号 / 退货日期 / 状态 / 供应商(客户) / 仓库 /
        原单号 …）→ 退货原因条 → 明细（采购退货多「价税合计」列；销售退货
        多「序列号」列）→ 合计 → 备注 → 签字栏 → 页脚。

   为什么用 **A4 横向**：两种退货单都要 12 列（物料三列 + 数量金额四列 +
   税率税额 + 库位 + 方向专列），纵向 538pt 装不下 —— 列被压窄后单价
   `12.345600` / 序列号会折行，打印件就没法逐行核对了。横向可用 786pt。

   打印四条铁律（与订单 / 出入库模板同源）：
     ① @page 定死纸张与外边距；
     ② thead { display: table-header-group } —— 明细跨页时表头重复；
     ③ tr / .sign / .summary / .reason { break-inside: avoid } —— 不腰斩；
     ④ .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums } —— 数量金额等宽右对齐。

   页码由 CDP footerTemplate 输出（`pdf::template::return_footer`）。
   =========================================================================== */
@page {
  size: A4 landscape;
  margin: 12mm 10mm 16mm 10mm;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 10pt;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #1f2329;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 页眉 ---------- */
.sheet-header {
  border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-bottom: 4pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.sheet-header .company {
  font-size: 12.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-title {
  font-size: 17pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 8pt;
  margin: 4pt 0 6pt;
}

/* ---------- 单据头 ---------- */
table.head-fields {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
table.head-fields td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.head-fields td.label {
  width: 70pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.head-fields td.value { width: auto; }

/* ---------- 退货原因条（验收③：退货原因必须是显眼的一块） ---------- */
.reason {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  border: 0.8pt solid #1f2329;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  padding: 4pt 8pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
  font-size: 10pt;
}
.reason .tag { font-weight: 700; }

/* ---------- 明细表 ---------- */
table.detail {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
  /* 固定列宽：auto 布局会按内容重算宽度，序列号列被挤到 100pt 以下 → 号码从中间折行。
     定死总宽度（横版可用 ≈785pt）后各列按声明值分配，剩余给「物料名称」。 */
  table-layout: fixed;
}
table.detail thead { display: table-header-group; }
table.detail th,
table.detail td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 2.4pt 3.5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.detail th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.detail tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
table.detail .c-seq { text-align: center; width: 22pt; }
table.detail .c-code { width: 76pt; white-space: nowrap; }
table.detail .c-name { width: auto; }
/* 规格 66pt（横版空间充裕）：56pt 会把 DN100/PN16 折行 */
table.detail .c-spec { width: 66pt; }
table.detail .c-unit { text-align: center; width: 26pt; }
table.detail .c-qty { width: 46pt; }
table.detail .c-price { width: 58pt; }
table.detail .c-amount { width: 62pt; }
table.detail .c-rate { width: 34pt; }
table.detail .c-tax { width: 56pt; }
table.detail .c-with-tax { width: 66pt; }
table.detail .c-loc { width: 52pt; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
table.detail .c-sn { width: 170pt; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
table.detail .c-code,
table.detail .c-name,
table.detail .c-spec { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

.num {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- 合计区（整块不跨页） ---------- */
.summary {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 8pt;
}
.summary table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
}
.summary table td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
}
.summary .label {
  width: 92pt;
  text-align: center;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.summary .value-cn { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; }

/* ---------- 签字栏 ---------- */
.sign {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 12pt;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8pt;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
.sign .box { flex: 1 1 0; }
.sign .cap { color: #4e5969; white-space: nowrap; }
.sign .line { margin-top: 16pt; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #4e5969; height: 1pt; }
.sign .date { margin-top: 3pt; color: #86909c; font-size: 8.5pt; }

.remark {
  margin-top: 9pt;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.remark .tag { font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329; }

.footnote {
  margin-top: 5pt;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #86909c;
  text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet-header">
  <div class="company">{{ company }}</div>
  <div class="doc-title">{{ doc_title }}</div>
</div>

<table class="head-fields">
{% for row in meta_rows %}
  <tr>
{% for field in row %}
    <td class="label">{{ field.label }}</td>
    <td class="value">{{ field.value }}</td>
{% endfor %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<div class="reason"><span class="tag">退货原因：</span>{{ reason }}</div>

<table class="detail">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th class="c-seq">#</th>
      <th class="c-code">物料编码</th>
      <th class="c-name">物料名称</th>
      <th class="c-spec">规格</th>
      <th class="c-unit">单位</th>
      <th class="c-qty">数量</th>
      <th class="c-price">单价</th>
      <th class="c-amount">金额</th>
      <th class="c-rate">税率(%)</th>
      <th class="c-tax">税额</th>
{% if show_with_tax %}
      <th class="c-with-tax">价税合计</th>
{% endif %}
      <th class="c-loc">库位</th>
{% if show_serials %}
      <th class="c-sn">序列号</th>
{% endif %}
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for item in items %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-seq">{{ item.seq }}</td>
      <td class="c-code">{{ item.material_code }}</td>
      <td class="c-name">{{ item.material_name }}</td>
      <td class="c-spec">{{ item.spec }}</td>
      <td class="c-unit">{{ item.unit }}</td>
      <td class="c-qty num">{{ item.qty }}</td>
      <td class="c-price num">{{ item.price }}</td>
      <td class="c-amount num">{{ item.amount }}</td>
      <td class="c-rate num">{{ item.tax_rate }}</td>
      <td class="c-tax num">{{ item.tax_amount }}</td>
{% if show_with_tax %}
      <td class="c-with-tax num">{{ item.with_tax }}</td>
{% endif %}
      <td class="c-loc">{{ item.location }}</td>
{% if show_serials %}
      <td class="c-sn">{{ item.serials }}</td>
{% endif %}
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="summary">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">行数合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:56pt">{{ row_count }}</td>
      <td class="label">数量合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:80pt">{{ total_qty }}</td>
      <td class="label">金额合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:96pt">{{ total_amount }}</td>
      <td class="label">税额</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:86pt">{{ total_tax }}</td>
      <td class="label">价税合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:96pt">{{ total_with_tax }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">价税合计大写</td>
      <td colspan="9" class="value-cn">{{ currency_cn }}{{ amount_cn }}（{{ currency_symbol }}{{ amount_for_upper }}）</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

{% if remark %}
<div class="remark"><span class="tag">备注：</span>{{ remark }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="sign">
{% for cap in sign_caps %}
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">{{ cap }}</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="footnote">打印时间：{{ printed_at }}　本单据由云枢系统生成（{{ engine }}）</div>
</body>
</html>
